{"id":"d73e3b0726a3b895","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-prikry-condition.md","title":"ZFC Prikry Condition","display":"df-zfc-prikry-condition — ZFC Prikry Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prikry-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-prikry-condition — ZFC Prikry Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prikry-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prikry-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prikry-condition — ZFC Prikry Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U,s,A,p\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,U,s,A,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad A\\in U,\\quad p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\">\\(s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad A\\in U,\\quad p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s(i)&lt;s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\xi\\in A\\;(\\eta&lt;\\xi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s(i)&lt;s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\xi\\in A\\;(\\eta&lt;\\xi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A condition includes the normal measure, a strictly increasing finite stem, and a measure-one tail above the stem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e059389c097fae1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,U,s,A,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\kappa^{<\\omega},\\quad A\\in U,\\quad p=\\langle s,A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S(p,s,A,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land p=\\langle s,A\\rangle\\land s\\in\\kappa^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall i<j<\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s(i)<s(j))\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\xi\\in A\\;(\\eta<\\xi)","display":true}],"bytes":1022,"backlinks":[{"id":"6a487bf2bfd4f11f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrikryCondition}_S$ (Prikry-condition predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-prikry-condition]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-prikry-condition.md|58-df-zfc-prikry-condition]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2e059389c097fae1"]}